    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22097" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεωφᾰν-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>looking like earth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικλίνων ἐπὶ τὸ -έστερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.2.4
			</span></i>: esp. in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ.</span>
			<i>a spot where a kind of ochre was dug</i>, at Samos, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				61
			</span></i>:—so <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεωφά̆ν-ιον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεωφά̆ν-ειον</span></b> , τό<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, περὶ τοῦ γ.</span> title of speech by <i><span class="en">
				Din.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Din.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				149
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				229.21
			</span></i>.</div>
